{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124458","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124458/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124458/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124458/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124458","id":5844066792,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXFVh6A","number":124458,"title":"`CAMERA_VISIBLE_LAYERS` is not assigned in the shadow pass and reads uninitialized memory","user":{"login":"El-Chiang","id":22373989,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzczOTg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22373989?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/El-Chiang","html_url":"https://github.com/El-Chiang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/El-Chiang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/El-Chiang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/El-Chiang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/El-Chiang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/El-Chiang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/El-Chiang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/El-Chiang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/El-Chiang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/El-Chiang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-14T07:52:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T11:09:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.2.stable [ed1daf0bf]\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS - Godot v4.7.2.stable - Apple M4 Pro - Metal 4.0 (Forward+ and Mobile), also Vulkan 1.2.334 (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn my project, a shader uses `CAMERA_VISIBLE_LAYERS` to cut objects out of a water reflection, and shadows occasionally flicker. using an MRP, I read back the value of CAMERA_VISIBLE_LAYERS during the shadow pass, it’s not the camera’s cull mask but a changing value. The cause is that this field has no default value.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/render_scene_data_rd.h#L49\n\nI worked around it in my project by checking `IN_SHADOW_PASS` first. Giving the field a default of `0xFFFFFFFF` should fix it.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. new a 3d scene: a DirectionalLight3D with shadows on, a ground plane, a cube\n2. give the cube a ShaderMaterial with:\n```\nshader_type spatial;\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tif ((CAMERA_VISIBLE_LAYERS & 1u) == 0u) {\n\t\tdiscard;\n\t}\n}\n```\n3. run with Foward+: the cube is visible but casts no shadow\n4. run the Compatibility: the shadow is there\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124458/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124458/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}